{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discord \uff1a<u></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Game Is Just Getting Started\uff01</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Missile Gene</i> offers two main modes: <strong>Stage Mode</strong> and <strong>Endless Mode</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Stage Mode, your goal is to create a powerful <strong>Build Card</strong>, making key decisions along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Endless Mode, you'll use your Build Card to take on extreme challenges \u2014 how long can you survive?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teammate System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532610/extras/89cfd477413d8ee919148905d13db1c8.avif?t=1752051964\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over <strong>30 unique heroes</strong> can randomly join you as teammates, each bringing their own opportunities and challenges.\u3002</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Backpack System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532610/extras/67f8b0b2b29904765c3d3f2b2821590f.avif?t=1752051964\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unprecedented freedom in customization \u2014 to create a satisfying Build Card, you'll need to think carefully about what you truly need.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outfit System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532610/extras/1dc0445580bae89e7375ed3b82d8cb17.avif?t=1752051964\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your look and power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Capes and weapons aren't just cosmetics \u2014 they significantly boost your character's performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build Card</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532610/extras/53edfd082d8e6be7892255476010293f.avif?t=1752051964\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finally \u2014 the <strong>Build Card</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the record of all your choices, your luck, and your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And yes... <i>this is where the real game begins.</i></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3532610?t=1752051964","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3532610?t=1752051964","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532610/636dc04cdb2efd1ac025fb8d30b0742e2e85967b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752051964","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532610/636dc04cdb2efd1ac025fb8d30b0742e2e85967b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752051964","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3703980,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discord \uff1a<u></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Game Is Just Getting Started\uff01</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Missile Gene</i> offers two main modes: <strong>Stage Mode</strong> and <strong>Endless Mode</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Stage Mode, your goal is to create a powerful <strong>Build Card</strong>, making key decisions along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Endless Mode, you'll use your Build Card to take on extreme challenges \u2014 how long can you survive?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_pa